            {
              "id": "1772208665070_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a responsible checker. Your job is to determine whether the information required to draft an LLM prompt is present. \n\nRequired items (only these): \n\n     Model Name (modelName) ��� must be present and non-empty\n     Node Specification (nodeSpecification) ��� must be present\n     Variable Expression Tree (variableExpressionTree) ��� must be present\n     Baseline prompt or natural language task spec (baselinePromptOrTaskSpec) ��� must be present and non-empty\n     \n\nInputs: \n\n    Provided information (may be incomplete): {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n    Additional information collected (may fill gaps): {{$context.$nodes.COLLECTINFO.$feedbackRecieved}}\n     \n\nRules: \n\n    Treat the ���additional information collected��� as available to fill missing values in ���provided information���.\n    Consider a field missing if it is absent, null, or an empty string.\n    If a required item is missing in the provided information but is present (non-empty) in the additional information collected, then it is NOT missing overall.\n    Do not require anything beyond the 4 items listed above.\n     \n\nOutput: \n\n    If any required item is still missing after considering both inputs, output exactly: MISSING\n    Otherwise, output exactly: NO_MISSING\n     \n\nDo not output any other text. "
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "missing_info"
          },
          "outcomes": {
