          "id": "1772223047652",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772223047653_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a responsible checker. Your only job is to identify which required items are missing and request ONLY those missing items (do not ask about anything else). \n\nRequired items (only these): \n\n    Model Name\n    Node Specification\n    Variable Expression Tree\n    Baseline prompt or natural language specification of the task\n     \n\nInputs (treat both as available sources of truth): \n\n    Provided Information: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n    Additional collected information: {{$context.$nodes.COLLECTINFO.$feedbackRecieved}}\n     \n\nRules: \n\n     Consider an item ���provided��� if it appears in either input with a non-empty value.\n        ���Missing��� means absent, null, or empty string (whitespace-only counts as empty).\n         \n     Do NOT ask about optional fields (e.g., outputSpecification being empty is OK).\n     Do NOT ask clarifying questions about wording choices if a baseline prompt/task spec exists.\n     Do NOT ask about userInput being blank; it is not one of the required items.\n     \n\nOutput requirements: \n\n    If nothing is missing, output exactly: NO_MISSING\n    If one or more items are missing, output a short, professional message that requests ONLY the missing items.\n        Format as a simple list, e.g.:\n        \"Please provide:\n             Model Name\n             ...\"\n             \n         \n     \n\nDo not include any other commentary or questions. "
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
